Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the action after the guard has caught the player: on dismissing the dialogue it sets EVENTCHKINF_CAUGHT_BY_CASTLE_GUARDS and starts a starburst transition to ENTR_HYRULE_CASTLE_4, ejecting the player from the castle grounds.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Heishi3/z_en_heishi3.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
